# Rules Organization Rules

## Rule 3 (v020): Rules Files Organization

- All development rules must be placed in the `rules/` folder
- Each rules file must be referenced in the `README.md` at a strategically chosen location
- Rules must be organized by theme in separate files to facilitate maintenance and consultation

This organization allows centralizing all development rules while keeping the main README clear and organized.
